<title>MEXICO: Carso Global Telecom Q1 net 546.96 mln.</title>
<headline>Carso Global Telecom Q1 net 546.96 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p>	Shr			   n/a		     n/a</p>
<p>	Net		   546.96 million		    n/a</p>
